    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install codenomad
```

Chocolatey downloads the official 64-bit archive at install time, unpacks it into the package tools directory and shims the executables it contains. The package itself carries no binaries.

Install a specific version:

```powershell
choco install codenomad --version=<version>
```

## What is CodeNomad?

CodeNomad: The command center that puts AI coding on steroids.

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade codenomad
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall codenomad
```

